3 {\n    font-size: 1.3em;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #2d3748;\n    margin-bottom: 0.2em;\n}\n\n.experience-item .year {\n    color: #718096;\n    font-size: 0.9em;\n    margin-bottom: 0.2em;\n}\n\n.experience-item .role {\n    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #2c5282, #4299e1);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    font-size: 1.1em;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin-bottom: 0.3em;\n}\n\n.experience-item .description {\n    color: #4a5568;\n    font-size: 0.95em;\n    margin-top: 0.5em;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.experience-item::before {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -8px;\n    top: 0;\n    width: 13px;\n    height: 13px;\n    background: #4299e1;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n}\n</style>\n\n:::{#hero-heading}\n\n<div class=\"name-title\">Peyman Kor</div>\n\n<div class=\"headline\">AI & Decision Analytics | GenAI Researcher & Educator | Data Scientist </div>\n\n<div class=\"summary-section\">\n<h2>Summary</h2>\n\nI'm Peyman Kor - a Data Scientist and Machine Learning/AI Researcher.\n\nOriginally from [Bandar Torkaman](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bandar_Torkaman){target=\"_blank\"} in northern Iran, I'm now based in Norway, completing my Ph.D. in Reinforcement Learning. \n\n\n<!--**Currently** I am exploring three main areas:\n\n<div class=\"research-areas\">\n1. Agentic AI and LLM workflow for automation and productivity.\n2. Reinforcement Learning for improving reasoning in LLMs.\n3. Decision-quality and science of better decision making.\n</div>\n-->\n\nMy doctoral work focuses on Reinforcement Learning, investigating both classical approaches [like Q-learning](https://www.mdpi.com/1999-4893/17/9/400){target=\"_blank\"} and innovative applications such as RL for LLMs [Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback](https://github.com/Peymankor/RLHF/blob/main/main.pdf){target=\"_blank\"}. \n\nPrior to my PhD, as a Data Scientist, I was part of a successful industry collaboration project focused on optimizing, resulting in developing an innovative [Bayesian Optimization](https://onepetro.org/SJ/article-abstract/29/02/620/535724/Reservoir-Production-Management-With-Bayesian?redirectedFrom=fulltext){target=\"_blank\"} workflow.\n\nPreviously, I studied at the Technical University of Denmark and worked on diverse computational projects. In addition, I hold an M.Sc in Engineering from the University of Stavanger, specializing [developing practical ML solutions](https://bookdown.org/kor_peyman/masterthesisuis/){target=\"_blank\"} for real-world problems.\n\nI'm actively engaged on [GitHub](https://github.com/peymankor){target=\"_blank\"} and regularly share findings through my [blog](/blog){target=\"_blank\"}.\n\n<div class=\"experience-section\">\n<h2>Experience</h2>\n\n<div class=\"experience-item\">\n<h3>NORCE & UiS</h3>\n<div class=\"year\">Jan 2021 - Dec 2021</div>\n<div class=\"role\">Data Scientist</div>\n<div class=\"description\">\n• Developed novel machine learning model for production optimization in subsurface applications\n\n• Designed and tested algorithms for probabilistic modeling, improving computational efficiency by 500%\n\n• Collaborated with stakeholders from eight Norwegian energy companies, ensuring seamless integration of analytical insights into decision-making\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"experience-item\">\n<h3>Decarbonify</h3>\n<div class=\"year\">Jan 2020 - June 2020</div>\n<div class=\"role\">Data Scientist</div>\n<div class=\"description\">Established and implemented a database system leading to efficient data extraction and analysis using SQL.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"experience-item\">\n<h3>AKER BP</h3>\n<div class=\"year\">Jun 2019 - Aug 2019</div>\n<div class=\"role\">Data Scientist Intern</div>\n<div class=\"description\">\n• Developed a probabilistic reserve estimate dashboard tool using R Shiny/RStudio to provide real-time data-driven insights for decision-making\n\n• Analyzed over 10,000 scenarios using Monte Carlo Simulations, allowing data-driven decision-making and improved risk assessment\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"education-section\">\n<h2>Education</h2>\n\n<div class=\"education-item\">\n<h3>University of Stavanger</h3>\n<div class=\"year\">2022 - 2024</div>\n<div class=\"degree\">PhD in Applied Data Science & Machine Learning</div>\n<div class=\"description\">Focus: Optimization, Quantitative Finance (Option Trading & Derivatives). Skills: Python, R, SQL, Scientific Reporting.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"education-item\">\n<h3>Technical University of Denmark</h3>\n<div class=\"year\">2019 - 2020</div>\n<div class=\"degree\">Advanced Studies in Data Science & Machine Learning</div>\n<div class=\"description\">Completed a one-year specialized program in Data Science, Machine Learning and Mathematical Modeling.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"education-item\">\n<h3>University of Stavanger</h3>\n<div class=\"year\">2017 - 2019</div>\n<div class=\"degree\">MSc in Engineering</div>\n<div class=\"description\">MSc Thesis: Decision-Driven Data Analytics for Well Placement Optimization in Field Development Scenario-Powered by Machine Learning.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"contact-links\">\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/peyman-kor/\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"bi bi-linkedin\"></i> LinkedIn</a>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/peyman_kor\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"bi bi-twitter\"></i> Twitter</a>\n<a href=\"https://medium.com/@peymankor\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"bi bi-medium\"></i> Medium</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/peymankor\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"bi bi-github\"></i> GitHub</a>\n<a href=\"mailto:kor.peyman@gmail.com\"><i class=\"bi bi-envelope\"></i> Email</a>\n</div>\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"